rare_chars (rc4) algorithm and tables
======================================

Adapted from https://github.com/RinshannKaihou/self_evolving_inference_detector
(package v35_detector 0.4.0; research commit 5118334 for rc4).

Files under this directory (rare.py, rare_vocab.py, rare_gb.py, rare_ref.py,
rc4.json, tables/*.npz) preserve the evaluated detector logic and frozen
artifacts. Guard wiring, Ascend (top1, chosen) logprob collection, and the
ConfigBackedDetector wrapper live outside this package.
